config USB_TYPE_C_ANX7688
	tristate "Analogix ANX7688 USB Type-C / PD controller (Light L16)"
	depends on I2C && GPIOLIB && POWER_SUPPLY
	help
	  Stock Light L16 ANX7688 driver (Analogix reference driver 2.1.11 as
	  integrated by FIH), ported to mainline. Handles cable detect, chip
	  power sequencing and USB Power Delivery through the chip's on-chip
	  firmware. The on-chip firmware updater is not included.
